an aspis drone~
An aspis drone stands on his hind legs and watches you cautiously.
~
This 6 to 7 foot long, giant insect looks a great deal like a weevil.  It had
been moving on all six legs but stood up on its hind legs and assumed a
defensive posture when it became aware of your presence.  Its antennae and
large eyes, which are set on the sides of its head, make it clear to you it
would be impossible to approach this creature unnoticed.
~
