#5904
A W 0~
aspis guardian m5904~
an aspis guardian~
An aspis guardian rears onto his hind legs and moves menacingly toward you.
~
Compared to the drones, this aspis is huge.  You also notice other pronounced
differences.  The chitinous armor of this aspis appears thicker and much
harder than the drones and its rear limbs are a great deal larger.  You also
see the last section of one of its middle limbs terminates into a hard, broad
and flattened ovoid shape that could be used like a shield as well as a
weapon.
~
