#5905
A W 0~
aspis larva m5905~
an aspis larva~
An aspis larva blindly searches for food.
~
The aspis larva is 3 to 4 feet in length and looks like a giant grub.  It has
neither antennae nor eyes, so the only way to distinguish its head from its
tail is by the wider girth of the head region or, if it happens to be moving,
by its direction of travel.  Its haphazard movements around the cavern makes
you realize it has not yet gained its sight.
~
