A W 0~
aspis cow m5906~
the aspis cow~
The aspis cow is here laying its eggs.
~
The aspis cow looks much like the grub-like larva but measures nearly 15 feet
in length.  However, the cow has fully formed eyes and antennae which, while
possessing subtle differences, are much like those of the drones.  The mouth
of cow is enormous, with large mandibles that look like they could crush a
man easily.
~
