mount dragon death m5910~
Kord's mount~
A huge, black dragon fitted with a saddle stands here.
~
You see before you a huge, black dragon wearing an ornate saddle of jet and
gold.  You see upon the saddle the intricate design generally associated with
Kord.  Although this ancient, big black stands here passively, leaving
bystanders unmolested, it is obvious from the fire in her eyes it isn't her
own will which keeps her in check.
~
